          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Lasso, LassoLars, Ridge\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\n\n# PATOLOGI 1: p >> n (n=40 sampel, p=150 fitur, 60 sinyal sejati)\nn_small, p_large = 40, 150\nX_hi = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_small, p_large))\nX_hi = (X_hi - X_hi.mean(axis=0)) / X_hi.std(axis=0)\nbeta_dense = np.zeros(p_large)\nbeta_dense[:60] = rng.uniform(0.8, 1.5, size=60)\ny_hi = X_hi @ beta_dense + rng.normal(0.0, 0.5, size=n_small)\n\nprint(\"=== PATOLOGI 1: Batas Maksimal n-1 Variabel Lasso (LassoLars Eksak) pada p=150 >> n=40 ===\")\nfor alpha in [0.5, 0.1, 0.01, 0.001]:\n    m = LassoLars(alpha=alpha, max_iter=500).fit(X_hi, y_hi)\n    nnz = int(np.sum(np.abs(m.coef_) > 1e-8))\n    print(f\"  alpha={alpha:6.3f} -> fitur aktif = {nnz:2d} (batas teoretis <= n-1={n_small - 1}, padahal 60 fitur sinyal sejati)\")\n\n# PATOLOGI 2: Ketidakstabilan Seleksi pada Fitur Berkorelasi Sangat Tinggi (rho ~ 0.992)\nn_c = 140\nz = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n_c)\nX0 = z + rng.normal(0.0, 0.09, size=n_c)\nX1 = z + rng.normal(0.0, 0.09, size=n_c)\nX_noise = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_c, 8))\nX_corr = np.column_stack([X0, X1, X_noise])\nX_corr = (X_corr - X_corr.mean(axis=0)) / X_corr.std(axis=0)\ny_corr = 1.5 * X_corr[:, 0] + 1.5 * X_corr[:, 1] + rng.normal(0.0, 2.0, size=n_c)\nemp_rho = float(np.corrcoef(X_corr[:, 0], X_corr[:, 1])[0, 1])\n\nlasso_w0, lasso_w1, ridge_w0, ridge_w1 = [], [], [], []\npick_x0_only, pick_x1_only = 0, 0\nfor _ in range(30):\n    idx = rng.integers(0, n_c, size=n_c)\n    ml = Lasso(alpha=0.60, max_iter=5000).fit(X_corr[idx], y_corr[idx])\n    mr = Ridge(alpha=5.0).fit(X_corr[idx], y_corr[idx])\n    lasso_w0.append(ml.coef_[0])\n    lasso_w1.append(ml.coef_[1])\n    ridge_w0.append(mr.coef_[0])\n    ridge_w1.append(mr.coef_[1])\n    if abs(ml.coef_[0]) > 1e-4 and abs(ml.coef_[1]) <= 1e-4:\n        pick_x0_only += 1\n    elif abs(ml.coef_[1]) > 1e-4 and abs(ml.coef_[0]) <= 1e-4:\n        pick_x1_only += 1\n\nprint(f\"=== PATOLOGI 2: Bootstrap Stability (30x) pada Pasangan Korelasi rho={emp_rho:.3f} ===\")\nprint(f\"Lasso (alpha=0.60) -> mean(w0,w1)=({np.mean(lasso_w0):.2f}, {np.mean(lasso_w1):.2f}) | \"\n      f\"std=({np.std(lasso_w0):.2f}, {np.std(lasso_w1):.2f}) | pilih X0 saja={pick_x0_only}/30, X1 saja={pick_x1_only}/30\")\nprint(f\"Ridge (alpha=5.00) -> mean(w0,w1)=({np.mean(ridge_w0):.2f}, {np.mean(ridge_w1):.2f}) | \"\n      f\"std=({np.std(ridge_w0):.2f}, {np.std(ridge_w1):.2f}) | stabil membagi bobot merata\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== PATOLOGI 1: Batas Maksimal n-1 Variabel Lasso (LassoLars Eksak) pada p=150 >> n=40 ===\n  alpha= 0.500 -> fitur aktif = 28 (batas teoretis <= n-1=39, padahal 60 fitur sinyal sejati)\n  alpha= 0.100 -> fitur aktif = 36 (batas teoretis <= n-1=39, padahal 60 fitur sinyal sejati)\n  alpha= 0.010 -> fitur aktif = 39 (batas teoretis <= n-1=39, padahal 60 fitur sinyal sejati)\n  alpha= 0.001 -> fitur aktif = 39 (batas teoretis <= n-1=39, padahal 60 fitur sinyal sejati)\n=== PATOLOGI 2: Bootstrap Stability (30x) pada Pasangan Korelasi rho=0.992 ===\nLasso (alpha=0.60) -> mean(w0,w1)=(1.51, 0.97) | std=(0.89, 0.92) | pilih X0 saja=8/30, X1 saja=4/30\nRidge (alpha=5.00) -> mean(w0,w1)=(1.58, 1.48) | std=(0.25, 0.28) | stabil membagi bobot merata",
          "actualOutput": "=== PATOLOGI 1: Batas Maksimal n-1 Variabel Lasso (LassoLars Eksak) pada p=150 >> n=40 ===\n  alpha= 0.500 -> fitur aktif = 28 (batas teoretis <= n-1=39, padahal 60 fitur sinyal sejati)\n  alpha= 0.100 -> fitur aktif = 36 (batas teoretis <= n-1=39, padahal 60 fitur sinyal sejati)\n  alpha= 0.010 -> fitur aktif = 39 (batas teoretis <= n-1=39, padahal 60 fitur sinyal sejati)\n  alpha= 0.001 -> fitur aktif = 39 (batas teoretis <= n-1=39, padahal 60 fitur sinyal sejati)\n=== PATOLOGI 2: Bootstrap Stability (30x) pada Pasangan Korelasi rho=0.992 ===\nLasso (alpha=0.60) -> mean(w0,w1)=(1.51, 0.97) | std=(0.89, 0.92) | pilih X0 saja=8/30, X1 saja=4/30\nRidge (alpha=5.00) -> mean(w0,w1)=(1.58, 1.48) | std=(0.25, 0.28) | stabil membagi bobot merata",
