          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef scad_proximal_l1_norm(z, lam: float, a: float = 3.7) -> float:\n    arr = np.asarray(z, dtype=float)\n    # TODO: terapkan 3 cabang proksimal SCAD lalu kembalikan round(float(sum(|out|)), 4)\n    pass\n\nprint(scad_proximal_l1_norm([0.4, 0.9, 1.5, 2.2, -3.5], lam=0.5, a=3.7))",
